@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

title POST /api/games — Create Game

actor "Client" as C
participant "Flask\napi.py" as API
participant "GameManager\n(game/)" as GM
participant "SessionStore\n(game/)" as STORE

C -> API : POST /api/games\n{}
activate API

API -> API : generate UUID for game_id

API -> GM : new GameManager()
activate GM
GM -> GM : start_game()
deactivate GM

API -> STORE : save(game_id, gm)
activate STORE
note right of STORE
  Write to
  {save_dir}/{game_id}.json
end note
deactivate STORE

API --> C : 201 Created\n{"game_id": "<uuid>", "state": {...}}

deactivate API
@enduml
